(x,y)=|x-2|\n$$\n\nTherefore, the moment of inertia about the line $x=2$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (x,y)[r(x,y)]^{2}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{3x/4}^{3-3x/4}(2-x)|x-2{|}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{3x/4}^{3-3x/4}{(2-x)}^{3}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}(2-x)^{3}[{\\int }_{3x/4}^{3-3x/4}\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}(2-x)^{3}[y]_{3x/4}^{3-3x/4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}(2-x)^{3}(3-\\frac{3x}{4}-\\frac{3x}{4})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}(2-x)^{4}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{2}{[\\frac{(2-x)^{5}}{5}]}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{2}(0-\\frac{{2}^{5}}{5}) \\\\  & =\\frac{48}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535857 true] [17592186370623 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370624 13194139535857 true] [17592186370623 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370625 13194139535857 true] [17592186370623 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370626 13194139535857 true] [17592186370623 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370627 13194139535857 true] [17592186370623 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370628 13194139535857 true] [17592186370623 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535857 true] [17592186370623 1041 "selection" 13194139535857 true] [17592186370623 1104 #edb/ref 17592186370624 13194139535857 true] [17592186370623 1110 #uuid "c952dcfc-a287-59d9-b904-fd215324f412" 13194139535857 true] [17592186370624 1034 "\\frac{48}{5}" 13194139535857 true] [17592186370624 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535857 true] [17592186370624 1111 #uuid "61c73ace-ef7f-5218-bd77-4565b76e7172" 13194139535857 true] [17592186370625 1034 "\\frac{28}{5}" 13194139535857 true] [17592186370625 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535857 true] [17592186370625 1111 #uuid "a46f2926-a4af-55a2-a995-c293befd5f7d" 13194139535857 true] [17592186370626 1034 "\\frac{32}{5}" 13194139535857 true] [17592186370626 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535857 true] [17592186370626 1111 #uuid "86f549a8-9269-53c5-8538-c985739c7e61" 1319413