g the mass density function over the plate.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-2}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}k{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =k({\\int }_{-2}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x)({\\int }_{0}^{1}{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y) \\\\  & =k\\cdot [x]_{-2}^{2}\\cdot {[\\frac{1}{3}{y}^{3}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{k}{3}(2-(-2))(1-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{4k}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, \n\n$$\n\\lambda (x,y)=k{y}^{2}=\\frac{3M}{4}{y}^{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the moment of inertia about the line $y=2$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{l} & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (x,y)[r(x,y)]^{2}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-2}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{3M}{4}{y}^{2}|y-2{|}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-2}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{3M}{4}{y}^{2}(y-2)^{2}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3M}{4}({\\int }_{-2}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x)({\\int }_{0}^{1}({y}^{4}-4{y}^{3}+4{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}y) \\\\  & =\\frac{3M}{4}\\cdot [x]_{-2}^{2}\\cdot {[\\frac{{y}^{5}}{5}-{y}^{4}+\\frac{4{y}^{3}}{3}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{3M}{4}\\cdot (2-(-2))\\cdot (\\frac{1}{5}-1+\\frac{4}{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{3M}{4}\\cdot 4\\cdot \\frac{8}{15} \\\\  & =\\frac{8M}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535857 true] [17592186370672 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370673 13194139535857 true] [17592186370672 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370674 13194139535857 true] [17592186370672 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370675 13194139535857 true] [17592186370672 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370676 13194139535857 true] [17592186370672 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370677 13194139535857 true] [17592186370672 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535857 true] [17592186370672 1041 "selection" 13194139535857 true] [17592186370672 1104 #edb/ref 17592186370676 13194139535857 true] [17592186370672 1110 #uuid "8df614d9-7e07-5591-a7fb-c9179f189efb" 13194139535857 true] [17592186370673 1034 "\\frac{16M}{5}" 13194139535857 true] [17592186370673 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535857 true] [17592186370673 1111 #uuid "63fdb99b-6ee2-5282